  "intro": "This relaxed 7-day Bali itinerary is built for families: two or three calm bases — Sanur, Ubud and Nusa Dua — instead of constant moving, with kid-friendly highlights like Bali Safari, Waterbom and gentle rice-terrace walks, and plenty of pool time between adventures.",
