          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k0",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bali is one of the easiest places in Asia to travel with children, and this relaxed seven-day plan keeps it that way: two calm bases instead of constant moving, short drives, early nights, and plenty of pool and beach time between the big-ticket family days. You swap Bali's nightlife and back-to-back temples for safari mornings, gentle rice-terrace walks and a world-class waterpark."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
