          "text": "Is 7 days enough for Bali with kids?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "k9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k8",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes — seven days is the sweet spot for a first family trip. It is enough to settle into two or three bases without packing up every morning, pairing beach and pool days in the south with nature and wildlife around Ubud. With young children, two relaxed bases always beat trying to see the whole island."
        }
      ]
    },
