        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "kw",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 1: Arrive in Bali and settle into Sanur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ky",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "kx",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fly into Denpasar (DPS) and transfer to Sanur — only about 15–30 minutes from the airport, which is exactly what you want after a long flight with kids. Sanur is Bali's most family-friendly beach town: a calm, reef-protected lagoon with shallow water, a flat 5 km beachfront path perfect for strollers and bikes, and an easygoing, low-traffic feel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "k13",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k10",
          "_type": "affiliateLinkRef",
          "placeholderId": "BOOKING_SANUR"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "kz",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Keep the first day gentle. Check in, let everyone swim or nap, and walk the boardwalk to an early beachfront dinner as the fishing boats come in. "
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k11",
          "marks": [
            "k10"
          ],
          "text": "Search family-friendly Sanur stays on Booking.com"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k12",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " — look for a hotel with a shallow pool and connecting or family rooms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "k14",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k15",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Day 2: Bali Safari and Marine Park"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "k1f",
      "style": "normal",
