          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k2t",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "dry season, April to October"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k2u",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", is easiest with children — sunny days and the calmest seas in Sanur and Nusa Dua. July and August are the busiest and priciest; "
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k2v",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "May, June and September"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "k2w",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " are quieter, still dry, and the sweet spot for families. The wet season (November–March) is warm but brings afternoon downpours that can disrupt outdoor days."
        }
      ]
    },
